Constraint (weekly mileage cap): the total distance of a week may be at most 10 percent higher than the total distance of the week before it. Week 1 has no earlier week to compare with. A decrease, no change, or an increase of exactly 10 percent satisfies the constraint. Only an increase of more than 10 percent violates it. The plan violates the constraint if at least one week violates it.

